{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17687","headline":"大堤曲 · 杨巨源","name":"大堤曲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"二八婵娟大堤女，开垆相对依江渚。\n待客登楼向水看，邀郎卷幔临花语。\n细雨蒙蒙湿芰荷，巴东商侣挂帆多。\n自传芳酒涴红袖，谁调妍妆回翠娥。\n珍簟华灯夕阳後，当垆理瑟矜纤手。\n月落星微五鼓声，春风摇荡牕前柳。\n岁岁逢迎沙岸间，北人多识绿云鬟。\n无端嫁与五陵少，离别烟波伤玉颜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨巨源","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17687.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17687","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}